1
00:00:00,921 --> 00:00:03,841
(Sheldon:)...to make a small purchase. Did you?

2
00:00:04,758 --> 00:00:06,638
(Sheldon:)No.

3
00:00:06,843 --> 00:00:09,223
Here's $2.

4
00:00:12,223 --> 00:00:14,723
Go buy some beefjerky.

5
00:00:21,358 --> 00:00:23,858
I don't want beefjerky.

6
00:00:26,696 --> 00:00:28,236
(Sheldon:)It's not about you.

7
00:00:28,406 --> 00:00:30,826
(Sheldon:)It's about a poor immigrant
from Pakistan...

8
00:00:30,992 --> 00:00:34,332
(Sheldon:)...trying to make his way in America
by working the graveyard shift...

9
00:00:34,496 --> 00:00:36,996
(Sheldon:)...at the Colorado Boulevard Chevron.

10
00:00:39,876 --> 00:00:41,756
(Leonard:)Fine.

11
00:00:43,171 --> 00:00:46,551
(Sheldon:)Needy baby, greedy baby, indeed.

12
00:00:48,093 --> 00:00:49,723
(Sheldon:)Leonard will be here in a moment.

13
00:00:49,886 --> 00:00:51,976
(Sheldon:)He's looking for
a different parking space.

14
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:54,890
- Why?
- We were next to a car with an...

15
00:00:55,058 --> 00:00:58,018
..."ask me about my grandchildren"
bumper sticker...

